Description: Command-line utility for Bitbake/Yocto build environments.
 bitbake-setup is used to set up, configure, and manage Yocto Project
 and OpenEmbedded build environments. It automates the process of fetching
 repositories (layers), generating configuration files and preparing the
 shell environment for building images.
